“From all of us at RWH who knew Dan, he was our inspiration and leader. We promise to honour his memory by ensuring that RWH continues to fulfill its mission of Helping Communities Worldwide.” — Jerry Zdril

“What we once enjoyed and deeply loved we can never lose, for all that we love deeply becomes a part of us.” — Jim McGrandles
